---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — AGLAYA"
  description="How AGLAYA handles personal data at aglaya.biz"
  lang="en"
  alternateUrlEs={new URL('/es/privacidad/', Astro.site).href}
  alternateUrlPt={new URL('/pt/privacidade/', Astro.site).href}
  noindex={true}
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-40 flex flex-col gap-12">
    <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-6xl uppercase tracking-tighter text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="max-w-2xl flex flex-col gap-6 text-white/70 font-body leading-relaxed">
      <p>Last updated: April 15, 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-white font-display font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-widest">Data We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit a contact, ROI Audit, or dispatch form, we may collect your name, email address, company, website, message, qualification inputs, and the submission context tied to that request. If bot protection is active, hCaptcha also processes technical verification data to help us block abuse.</p>

      <h2 class="text-white font-display font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-widest">How We Use It</h2>
      <p>We use inquiry data to review fit, respond to your request, qualify whether an engagement is justified, and route the lead operationally inside our systems. Dispatch subscriptions are used only to send the editorial updates you explicitly opt into.</p>

      <h2 class="text-white font-display font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-widest">Processors We Use</h2>
      <p>Transactional and notification emails are sent through Resend. Dispatch subscribers and segmented contact leads may be synced to MailerLite when that integration is enabled in our stack. Anti-abuse verification is handled by hCaptcha. We also use Sentry for technical error monitoring so we can detect and fix failures in the browser, Astro runtime, and form-processing functions. We do not sell your personal data.</p>

      <h2 class="text-white font-display font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-widest">Legal Basis</h2>
      <p>For proposal, contact, and ROI Audit requests, we process your data to handle the request you initiated, evaluate operational fit, and continue the pre-engagement conversation where justified. For dispatch subscriptions and optional marketing communications, we rely on the consent you grant at the form level and that you can withdraw at any time.</p>

      <h2 class="text-white font-display font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-widest">Analytics</h2>
      <p>If you accept all cookies, we may load analytics and measurement scripts via Google Tag Manager to understand aggregate traffic and interaction patterns. These scripts are not loaded until consent is granted.</p>

      <h2 class="text-white font-display font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-widest">Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access to, correction of, deletion of, or restriction on the personal data we hold by contacting <a href="mailto:info@aglaya.biz" class="text-brand hover:text-brand-light underline underline-offset-2">info@aglaya.biz</a>. If you subscribed to the dispatch, every dispatch email also contains an unsubscribe path.</p>

      <h2 class="text-white font-display font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-widest">Cookies</h2>
      <p>See our <a href="/cookies/" class="text-brand hover:text-brand-light underline underline-offset-2">Cookie Policy</a> for details on how we use cookies.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
